{"id":"9b1dba6be30381aa","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness.md","title":"最小 DFA 在同构意义下唯一","display":"thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness — 最小 DFA 在同构意义下唯一","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness","aliases":["73-thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness — 最小 DFA 在同构意义下唯一","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-minimization-construction]]","[[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa]]","[[73-thm-finite-residual-characterization]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 3.10, pp. 67–68; scans 75–76","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minimal-dfa-uniqueness — 最小 DFA 在同构意义下唯一"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaa557af281c04f0\" href=\"?note=eaa557af281c04f0\" title=\"73-df-dfa-minimization-construction\">73-df-dfa-minimization-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6c2dfbed164fa58\" href=\"?note=e6c2dfbed164fa58\" title=\"73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa\">73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce1461d3e7bc342b\" href=\"?note=ce1461d3e7bc342b\" title=\"73-thm-finite-residual-characterization\">73-thm-finite-residual-characterization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 3.10, pp. 67–68; scans 75–76"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)\">\\(N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)\\)</span> 是 DFA。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Q\\to P\">\\(h:Q\\to P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DFAIso}\">\\(\\operatorname{DFAIso}\\)</span> 在下式定义。语言、最小化及指数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eaa557af281c04f0\" href=\"?note=eaa557af281c04f0\" title=\"73-df-dfa-minimization-construction\">73-df-dfa-minimization-construction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e6c2dfbed164fa58\" href=\"?note=e6c2dfbed164fa58\" title=\"73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa\">73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ce1461d3e7bc342b\" href=\"?note=ce1461d3e7bc342b\" title=\"73-thm-finite-residual-characterization\">73-thm-finite-residual-characterization</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L(N)=L(M)\\Longrightarrow|\\pi_1(M)|\\le|\\pi_1(N)|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L(N)=L(M)\\Longrightarrow|\\pi_1(M)|\\le|\\pi_1(N)|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DFAIso}(M,N,h)\\leftrightarrow h:Q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P\\land h(q_0)=p_0\\land h[F]=H\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;h(\\delta(q,a))=\\eta(h(q),a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DFAIso}(M,N,h)\\leftrightarrow h:Q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P\\land h(q_0)=p_0\\land h[F]=H\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;h(\\delta(q,a))=\\eta(h(q),a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\nL(\\operatorname{Min}(M))=L(M)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{Min}(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\nL(\\operatorname{Min}(M))=L(M)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{Min}(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\land L(M)=L(N)\\Longrightarrow\\exists h:Q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P\\;\\operatorname{DFAIso}(M,N,h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\land L(M)=L(N)\\Longrightarrow\\exists h:Q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P\\;\\operatorname{DFAIso}(M,N,h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小机器的每个状态都可达，否则可删去。把读过同一前缀后到达的状态与该前缀的语言等价类对应：语言相同使对应相容；最小状态数等于指数使其为双射，并保持初态、终态和转移。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-minimization-construction","status":"resolved","id":"eaa557af281c04f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-minimization-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa","status":"resolved","id":"e6c2dfbed164fa58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-residual-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-residual-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-minimization-construction","status":"resolved","id":"eaa557af281c04f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"